1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,084
Hey, don't overthink it.

2
00:00:03,697 --> 00:00:06,342
Losing it once won't kill you.

3
00:00:06,984 --> 00:00:07,685
What are you saying?

4
00:00:09,126 --> 00:00:11,627
Just stay here tonight.

5
00:00:11,784 --> 00:00:14,249
If you need anything, just tell me.

6
00:00:14,249 --> 00:00:17,631
If you're hungry, grab anything
from the fridge. Help yourself.

7
00:00:19,244 --> 00:00:21,651
Alright… thank you, P'Night.

8
00:00:21,917 --> 00:00:25,437
Here, give me your number.
I'll call you if needed.

9
00:00:42,666 --> 00:00:45,720
And take my number too—
so you can reach me anytime.

10
00:00:47,865 --> 00:00:50,686
Get some rest tonight.
Make yourself comfortable.

11
00:00:50,811 --> 00:00:51,823
I won't bother you.

12
00:00:52,136 --> 00:01:01,807
Thanks… really.

13
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:36,479
Hello? Earth, where the hell are you?
You're pissing me off.

14
00:01:36,479 --> 00:01:39,582
Hello? Earth!!
